==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|faithful|ly}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# In a [[faithful]] manner.
#: ''The CD reproduces music faithfully.''
#: ''I have been faithfully married for the past twenty years.''
# {{context|US|lang=en}} A conventional [[formula]] for ending a [[letter]], used when the [[salutation]] addresses the person for whom the letter is intended using an [[honorific]].

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|formula for ending correspondence}} [[yours faithfully]] {{qualifier|UK}}<!--Note: "sincerely" is not a synonym as it is used differently-->

====Antonyms====
* [[unfaithfully]]

